WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.698
"I have to get to Metro City Central Bank," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:04.698 --> 00:00:08.542
"Somebody is robbing it!"

3
00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:11.695
She ran over to Mr. Green.

4
00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:14.044
"Mr. Green," said Roxy.

5
00:00:14.044 --> 00:00:16.258
"I just remembered something.

6
00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:20.564
Principal Penn wanted to, um, talk to me."

7
00:00:20.564 --> 00:00:25.742
"Go ahead, Roxy," said Mr. Green.

8
00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:29.028
A moment later Roxy shot through the air.

9
00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:34.074
"Look!" cried Mara. "Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:34.074 --> 00:00:35.605
Terrell scratched his head.

11
00:00:35.606 --> 00:00:39.047
"Where did Roxy go?"

12
00:00:39.048 --> 00:00:42.280
*** Roxy arrived at Metro City Central

13
00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.564
Bank. Police cars surrounded the

14
