17
00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:58.538
"Rocket Girl!" called Detective Smith.

18
00:00:58.538 --> 00:01:01.747
Roxy flew over to the detective.

19
00:01:01.747 --> 00:01:06.705
"Are you trying to deposit a check, Detective?" Roxy grinned.

20
00:01:06.706 --> 00:01:08.159
Detective Smith frowned.

21
00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:10.958
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl.

22
00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:14.142
A robbery is taking place!"

23
