Detective Smith nodded. "I think so."

26
00:01:23.725 --> 00:01:27.537
"Do you know who he is?" asked Roxy.

27
00:01:27.537 --> 00:01:30.165
A woman in the crowd stepped forward.

28
00:01:30.165 --> 00:01:34.204
"Do you mean 'what' he is?"

29
00:01:34.204 --> 00:01:36.846
Roxy was confused.

30
00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:39.650
"I saw the robber," said the woman.

31
00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:43.363
"He looks like a giant machine!"

32
00:01:43.363 --> 00:01:46.511
"It's true," said a man in a suit.

33
00:01:46.512 --> 00:01:48.745
"He's covered in big, heavy armor.

34
00:01:48.745 --> 00:01:51.441
He looks like an army tank!"

35
00:01:51.441 --> 00:01:54.550
"Hmm," said Detective Smith.

36
00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:59.979
"This must be connected to the crime at Metro City army base."

37
00:01:59.979 --> 00:02:03.621
"What happened at the army base?" asked Roxy.

38
00:02:03.621 --> 00:02:06.722
"Somebody stole a tank," said the detective.

39
00:02:06.722 --> 00:02:09.742
"It happened a couple of nights ago."

40
00:02:09.742 --> 00:02:14.193
"I'm coming out!" shouted a deep voice from inside the bank.

41
00:02:14.193 --> 00:02:18.184
