43
00:02:20.863 --> 00:02:22.835
"The bank is surrounded.

44
00:02:22.835 --> 00:02:25.492
Come out with your hands up!" "Ha-ha!"

45
00:02:25.492 --> 00:02:29.762
The deep voice laughed. "My

46
