name is Hank Tank, and I'm the toughest criminal in Metro City. Nobody

47
00:02:35.754 --> 00:02:38.473
can stop me. I'm

48
00:02:38.473 --> 00:02:43.623
coming out now with all the money I stole." Roxy

49
00:02:43.623 --> 00:02:49.240
heard heavy footsteps inside the bank. Stomp,

50
00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:54.737
stomp, stomp! The building and street shook. People

51
