ran in all different directions. "The

52
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:02.556
robber is coming out!" shouted a woman. "Run

53
00:03:02.556 --> 00:03:05.968
for your lives!" cried a man. Detective

54
00:03:05.967 --> 00:03:08.238
Smith gulped. "Hank

55
00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:11.753
Tank sounds pretty big." "Yeah."

56
00:03:11.753 --> 00:03:14.731
Roxy nodded. The

57
00:03:14.731 --> 00:03:16.795
